      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Rabinoff contributed all of the figures, the demos, and the technical aspects of the project, as detailed below.",
      "source_hash": 7417933408543793743,
      "context_hash": 6613738051696848394,
      "translation": "아래에 자세히 설명한 바와 같이, Rabinoff는 모든 그림과 데모, 그리고 프로젝트의 기술적인 부분을 담당했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rabinoff": "Rabinoff"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "The textbook is written in XML and compiled using a variant of Robert Beezer's <url href=\"https://mathbook.pugetsound.edu/\">MathBook XML</url>, as heavily modified by Rabinoff.",
      "source_hash": 10156474154917154161,
      "context_hash": 4273777445517229028,
      "translation": "이 교재는 XML로 작성되었으며, Rabinoff가 대폭 수정한 Robert Beezer의 <url href=\"https://mathbook.pugetsound.edu/\">MathBook XML</url> 변형판을 사용하여 컴파일됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rabinoff": "Rabinoff"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "The mathematical content of the textbook is written in LaTeX, then converted to HTML-friendly SVG format using a collection of scripts called PreTeX: this was coded by Rabinoff and depends heavily on <url href=\"https://inkscape.org/\">Inkscape</url> for pdf decoding and <url href=\"https://fontforge.github.io/\">FontForge</url> for font embedding.",
      "source_hash": 517689838308414591,
      "context_hash": 15576057103647331381,
      "translation": "교재의 수학 내용은 LaTeX로 작성된 뒤 PreTeX라는 스크립트 모음을 사용하여 HTML 친화적인 SVG 형식으로 변환됩니다. PreTeX는 Rabinoff가 작성했으며, PDF 디코딩에는 <url href=\"https://inkscape.org/\">Inkscape</url>를, 글꼴 임베딩에는 <url href=\"https://fontforge.github.io/\">FontForge</url>를 크게 활용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rabinoff": "Rabinoff"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:1",
      "source": "The figures are written in <url href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PGF/TikZ\">PGF/TikZ</url> and processed with PreTeX as well.",
      "source_hash": 17247208777061259767,
      "context_hash": 5413372627024709138,
      "translation": "그림은 <url href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PGF/TikZ\">PGF/TikZ</url>로 작성되며, 마찬가지로 PreTeX로 처리됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "The demonstrations are written in JavaScript+WebGL using Steven Wittens' brilliant framework called <url href=\"https://github.com/unconed/mathbox\">MathBox</url>.",
      "source_hash": 13266544242689093603,
      "context_hash": 11450680583488196648,
      "translation": "데모는 Steven Wittens의 훌륭한 프레임워크인 <url href=\"https://github.com/unconed/mathbox\">MathBox</url>를 사용하여 JavaScript+WebGL로 작성되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "All source code can be found on <url href=\"https://github.com/QBobWatson/ila\">GitHub</url>.",
      "source_hash": 2335247174829084540,
      "context_hash": 2834489270107013079,
      "translation": "모든 소스 코드는 <url href=\"https://github.com/QBobWatson/ila\">GitHub</url>에서 찾을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:1",
      "source": "It may be freely copied, modified, and redistributed, as detailed in the appendix entitled <q>GNU Free Documentation License.</q>",
      "source_hash": 3555044188588618693,
      "context_hash": 17371589455849362666,
      "translation": "<q>GNU Free Documentation License.</q>라는 제목의 부록에 자세히 설명한 바와 같이, 소스 코드는 자유롭게 복제, 수정, 재배포할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205953Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Larry Rolen wrote many of the exercises.",
      "source_hash": 5367830425606222564,
      "context_hash": 4887307510229479407,
      "translation": "Larry Rolen은 연습 문제의 상당수를 작성했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Larry": "Larry"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:25:38.205954Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Variants of this textbook",
      "source_hash": 382375030283429087,
      "context_hash": 10621136906281132090,
      "translation": "이 교재의 여러 판",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:16:59.505613Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There are several variants of this textbook available.",
      "source_hash": 6450114193545325796,
      "context_hash": 18265170663283513821,
      "translation": "이 교재는 여러 판으로 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:16:59.505614Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The <url href=\"/ila\">master version</url> is the default version of the book.",
      "source_hash": 15429982241942771836,
      "context_hash": 12212858651242326500,
      "translation": "<url href=\"/ila\">기본판</url>은 이 책의 기본 판입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:16:59.505615Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The <url href=\"/ila/1553\">version for math 1553</url> is fine-tuned to contain only the material covered in Math 1553 at Georgia Tech.",
      "source_hash": 14476897697696352988,
      "context_hash": 8443232497799324459,
      "translation": "<url href=\"/ila/1553\">Math 1553용 판</url>은 조지아 공과대학교(Georgia Tech)의 Math 1553에서 다루는 내용만 담도록 다듬은 판입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Georgia Tech": "조지아 공과대학교"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:16:59.505615Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The section numbering is consistent across versions.",
      "source_hash": 7098558453942937718,
      "context_hash": 4449446050135312038,
      "translation": "절 번호는 모든 판에서 동일하게 유지됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:16:59.505616Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This explains why Section 6.3 does not exist in the Math 1553 version, for example.",
      "source_hash": 3691626594151180433,
      "context_hash": 11989450763211148748,
      "translation": "예를 들어 Math 1553용 판에 6.3절이 없는 것은 이 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:16:59.505616Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "You are currently viewing the\n      <restrict-version versions=\"default\">\n        <em>master version</em>.\n      </restrict-version>\n      <restrict-version versions=\"1553\">\n        <em>version for math 1553</em>.\n      </restrict-version>",
      "source_hash": 8981711441326426549,
      "context_hash": 16898777707810567571,
      "translation": "현재 보고 계신 판은 <restrict-version versions=\"default\"> <em>기본판</em>입니다. </restrict-version> <restrict-version versions=\"1553\"> <em>Math 1553용 판</em>입니다. </restrict-version>",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:16:59.505616Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}